        "description": {
          "en-US": "VaultZero is an offline, zero-knowledge password manager. The APK has no\nINTERNET permission, no account, no analytics and no crash reporting.\n\nRecords are encrypted with AES-256-GCM (bound to id and type via AAD); the vault\nmaster key is wrapped with Argon2id (64 MiB, t=3) password and recovery-phrase\nenvelopes, with transparent migration from older PBKDF2 vaults. Recovery uses\nBIP-39 12-word kits; backups are encrypted, verified, duplicate-safe files\nwritten through the Android Storage Access Framework.\n\nThis repository is the Cipherwell beta channel. Every build here is signed with\nthe same VaultZero upload key; updates install over the previous version.\n\nEnglish and Spanish (US) UI, MIT licence.\n"
        },
